[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898399373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106648#issuecomment-2898399373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106648","id":2898399373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6swhCN","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T15:34:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T15:34:42Z","body":"Hotfix: EditorPaths needed to be inside an `#ifdef TOOLS`\r\n\r\nSummary of changes:\r\n* DisplayServer has been given some new virtual APIs to store the current \"session\" and it's path\r\n* Window now depends on DisplayServer for the session path instead of it being hardcoded to the `.godot` folder (which also removes the `\"editor/\" include)\r\n* The session path is set inside setup2 in `main.cpp` which should mean editor paths are fine and the paths will be different for the project manager, editor and running game.\r\n* Quick Settings in project manager persists state, to show how the project manager and editor store data in different locations\r\n* Window name renamed to session id\r\n \r\nThese haven't been added to the scripting api yet but once this seems stable enough they can be added easily so that projects can set session_ids to restore windows which should resolve https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10625 at least partially. I don't believe completely automatic session ids are possible because other current ids don't seem to have the stability or uniqueness requirements session_ids do but setting it is simple enough that it should be fine.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898399373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2902226026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106648#issuecomment-2902226026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106648","id":2902226026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s_HRq","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T18:43:33Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T18:43:33Z","body":"Updates\r\n* Removed `DisplayServer::window_get_session_id`. I believe it is unlikely it would actually be required for anything.\r\n* The API is now exposed in ClassDB. I did intend for this to be a generic API that projects can use to aid in session management\r\n* Adding to that there is now minor documentation for the new API\r\n* Other smaller changes, like always calling `DisplayServer::set_session_path` and Window actually calling `DisplayServer::window_set_session_id`\r\n\r\nAs for getting this out of draft status it would be helpful to get feedback on whether this seems like a sensible approach to restoring window attributes in the first place. If so, I would like to bring the current logic for restoring the editor window into this system but that is proving harder than I expected.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2902226026/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3566386823","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106648#issuecomment-3566386823","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106648","id":3566386823,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ukr6H","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-22T10:05:40Z","updated_at":"2025-11-22T10:07:29Z","body":"Very little has changed except that messing that being able to restore the initial window that gets created in the constructors of each display server is much more complex than restoring every other kind of window.\r\n\r\nIn theory, restoring the main window could perfectly well be a follow up PR if this is sufficient for now.\r\n\r\n@filantus is this sufficient? (haven't added the project setting to make it optional yet)\r\n[window-restore.mp4](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14f80496-06c9-4afc-8b0e-339c9c3bcb12)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3566386823/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3960312649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106648#issuecomment-3960312649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106648","id":3960312649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sDZNJ","user":{"login":"actforjason","id":57058325,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MDU4MzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57058325?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/actforjason","html_url":"https://github.com/actforjason","fol