,"site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-14T12:19:31Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T12:19:31Z","body":"> Maybe can refer to\r\n> \r\n> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/aac131f3865a712ea2274921618be3e9f790da1a/editor/gui/create_dialog.cpp#L70-L73\r\n> \r\n> This implements restoring the size and position of the create_new_node dialog.\r\n\r\nTheoretically, with this PR we could unify restoring the size + position of anything that inherits from `Window`. This section of code is similar to what's implemented here (store the last known position of a window in a specific field, then try to retrieve).\r\n\r\nI haven't done that to lower the surface area of the PR but I've noticed there's several popups that also use this \"dialog_bounds\" section which could probably get refactored.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4060462359/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4061193604","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106648#issuecomment-4061193604","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106648","id":4061193604,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yEOWE","user":{"login":"actforjason","id":57058325,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MDU4MzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57058325?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/actforjason","html_url":"https://github.com/actforjason","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actforjason/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actforjason/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actforjason/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actforjason/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actforjason/subscrip